{"seq":1,"slug":"upload-validation-scanning","title":"上传校验与病毒扫描","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-file-upload-streaming/security-reliability/upload-validation-scanning","wordCount":1349,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"上传校验与病毒扫描\">上传校验与病毒扫描</h1><p>文件上传是后端系统对外暴露的最大攻击面之一。2025 年 OWASP 将「不安全的文件上传」列为 Web 应用十大风险之一的重要构成。攻击者可以上传伪装为图片的 WebShell、嵌入恶意宏的 Office 文档、触发服务端解析漏洞的畸形文件。防御必须在入口处建立多层校验体系——从扩展名到 MIME 到 magic bytes 到内容深度扫描，层层递进。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Magic Bytes</strong>：文件头部固定位置的字节签名，是识别真实文件类型的权威依据（不可被客户端伪造）</li>\n<li><strong>多层校验模型</strong>：按检查成本从低到高排列——请求级 → 文件头 → 内容结构 → 病毒扫描，越早拒绝越省资源</li>\n<li><strong>隔离区（Quarantine）</strong>：文件在病毒扫描通过前暂存的区域，不可被公开访问</li>\n<li><strong>白名单策略</strong>：始终使用允许列表而非禁止列表——黑名单注定被绕过</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"校验层次模型\">校验层次模型</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Upload[上传请求] --&gt; L1[L1: 请求级校验]&#10;    L1 --&gt; L2[L2: 文件头校验]&#10;    L2 --&gt; L3[L3: 内容结构校验]&#10;    L3 --&gt; L4[L4: 病毒/恶意代码扫描]&#10;    L4 --&gt; Accept[接受存储]&#10;    L1 --&gt;|拒绝| Reject[返回 400]&#10;    L2 --&gt;|拒绝| Reject&#10;    L3 --&gt;|拒绝| Reject&#10;    L4 --&gt;|拒绝| Quarantine[隔离 + 告警]\">graph TD\n    Upload[上传请求] --&gt; L1[L1: 请求级校验]\n    L1 --&gt; L2[L2: 文件头校验]\n    L2 --&gt; L3[L3: 内容结构校验]\n    L3 --&gt; L4[L4: 病毒/恶意代码扫描]\n    L4 --&gt; Accept[接受存储]\n    L1 --&gt;|拒绝| Reject[返回 400]\n    L2 --&gt;|拒绝| Reject\n    L3 --&gt;|拒绝| Reject\n    L4 --&gt;|拒绝| Quarantine[隔离 + 告警]</pre><p>每一层的检查成本递增，因此按成本从低到高排列——越早拒绝，浪费的资源越少。</p>\n<h2 id=\"l1-请求级校验\">L1：请求级校验</h2><p>在解析文件内容之前就可以执行的低成本检查：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>校验项</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>拒绝条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Content-Length</td>\n<td>HTTP 头</td>\n<td>超过单文件限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件数量</td>\n<td>Multipart part 计数</td>\n<td>超过允许数量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件名</td>\n<td>Content-Disposition</td>\n<td>含路径遍历字符（<code>../</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展名</td>\n<td>文件名后缀</td>\n<td>不在白名单内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Content-Type</td>\n<td>per-part 头</td>\n<td>不在允许 MIME 列表内</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const ALLOWED_EXTENSIONS = new Set([&#39;.jpg&#39;, &#39;.jpeg&#39;, &#39;.png&#39;, &#39;.webp&#39;, &#39;.pdf&#39;, &#39;.mp4&#39;]);&#10;const MAX_FILE_SIZE = 100 * 1024 * 1024; // 100 MB&#10;const MAX_FILE_COUNT = 10;&#10;&#10;function validateRequest(info: FileInfo): ValidationResult {&#10;  const ext = path.extname(info.filename).toLowerCase();&#10;&#10;  if (!ALLOWED_EXTENSIONS.has(ext)) {&#10;    return { valid: false, reason: &#39;INVALID_EXTENSION&#39;, detail: ext };&#10;  }&#10;  if (info.filename.includes(&#39;..&#39;) || info.filename.includes(&#39;/&#39;)) {&#10;    return { valid: false, reason: &#39;PATH_TRAVERSAL&#39; };&#10;  }&#10;  return { valid: true };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ALLOWED_EXTENSIONS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.jpg'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.jpeg'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.png'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.webp'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.pdf'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.mp4'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MAX_FILE_SIZE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 100 MB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MAX_FILE_COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> validateRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">info</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FileInfo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ValidationResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ext</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> path.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">extname</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(info.filename).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toLowerCase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ALLOWED_EXTENSIONS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ext)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { valid: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'INVALID_EXTENSION'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, detail: ext };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (info.filename.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'..'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> info.filename.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { valid: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PATH_TRAVERSAL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { valid: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>扩展名白名单 vs 黑名单</strong>：始终使用白名单。黑名单模式（禁止 <code>.exe</code>, <code>.bat</code> 等）注定失败——攻击者总能找到未列入黑名单的危险扩展名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"l2-文件头校验-magic-bytes\">L2：文件头校验（Magic Bytes）</h2><p>客户端声明的 Content-Type 和扩展名都可被伪造。真正的文件类型由文件头的 magic bytes 决定：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>期望类型</th>\n<th>必须匹配的 Magic Bytes</th>\n<th>字节偏移</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>JPEG</td>\n<td><code>FF D8 FF</code></td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PNG</td>\n<td><code>89 50 4E 47 0D 0A 1A 0A</code></td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GIF</td>\n<td><code>47 49 46 38 39 61</code> 或 <code>...37 61</code></td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PDF</td>\n<td><code>25 50 44 46 2D</code></td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MP4</td>\n<td><code>66 74 79 70</code></td>\n<td>4（ftyp box）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WebP</td>\n<td><code>52 49 46 46</code> + <code>57 45 42 50</code></td>\n<td>0, 8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ZIP/DOCX/XLSX</td>\n<td><code>50 4B 03 04</code></td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"var magicTable = map[string][]byte{&#10;    &quot;image/jpeg&quot;: {0xFF, 0xD8, 0xFF},&#10;    &quot;image/png&quot;:  {0x89, 0x50, 0x4E, 0x47, 0x0D, 0x0A, 0x1A, 0x0A},&#10;    &quot;image/gif&quot;:  {0x47, 0x49, 0x46, 0x38},&#10;    &quot;application/pdf&quot;: {0x25, 0x50, 0x44, 0x46},&#10;}&#10;&#10;func validateMagicBytes(header []byte, expectedMime string) bool {&#10;    expected, ok := magicTable[expectedMime]&#10;    if !ok {&#10;        return false&#10;    }&#10;    if len(header) &lt; len(expected) {&#10;        return false&#10;    }&#10;    return bytes.Equal(header[:len(expected)], expected)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> magicTable </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"image/jpeg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">